## CI/CD 优化

### CI 流水线速度优化

CI 流水线是自动化的核心。慢的 CI 会阻塞所有开发者的工作流。

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph "优化前 (25 分钟)"
    A1[安装依赖\n5min] --> B1[Lint\n3min]
    B1 --> C1[类型检查\n4min]
    C1 --> D1[单元测试\n8min]
    D1 --> E1[构建\n3min]
    E1 --> F1[E2E 测试\n2min]
    end

    subgraph "优化后 (8 分钟)"
    A2[安装依赖\n30s 缓存] --> B2[并行执行]
    B2 --> B2a[Lint 1min]
    B2 --> B2b[类型检查 2min]
    B2 --> B2c[单元测试 3min]
    B2a --> C2[构建 2min]
    B2b --> C2
    B2c --> C2
    C2 --> D2[E2E 1min]
    end
```

### CI 优化技巧清单

| 技巧       | 效果                   | 实施难度 |
| ---------- | ---------------------- | -------- |
| 依赖缓存   | 安装从分钟级降到秒级   | 低       |
| 任务并行   | 总时间 ≈ 最长任务时间  | 低       |
| 增量构建   | 只构建变更的包         | 中       |
| 按需测试   | 只运行受影响的测试     | 中       |
| 远程缓存   | 跨 PR 复用构建结果     | 高       |
| 分级流水线 | 快速检查先行，慢速后行 | 中       |

### GitHub Actions 优化示例

```yaml
name: CI
on: [pull_request]

jobs:
  quality:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: 20
          cache: 'pnpm'
      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

      - name: Parallel Checks
        run: |
          pnpm run lint &
          pnpm run typecheck &
          pnpm run test -- --reporter=dot &
          wait

  build:
    needs: quality
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: 20
          cache: 'pnpm'
      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
      - run: pnpm build
```

